  "extension_address_requirement": "CREATE2 salt mined so the address encodes callpoints beforeInitializePool, beforeSwap, beforeUpdatePosition (zeroSeedLaunchCallPoints(); high byte 0x51 in tests); constructor registers with Core",
  "quote": "No constructor quote and no quoteToken() getter. Each launch selects LaunchParameters.quoteToken; it is the other token of that launch's pool key and never changes. One extension and one periphery serve every quote. address(0) is native ETH (always token0, launch token always token1). A nonzero quote without code is refused (UnsupportedQuoteToken) by preview and creation; nothing else screens an ERC-20 quote, whose risks are local to its own pair.",
  "note": "runtime hashes below have immutables zeroed; deployed runtimes embed CORE (extension, periphery) and LAUNCH (periphery). Do not pin by template hash alone."
 },
