 "supply": {
  "requested": "LaunchParameters.supply: submitted unchanged by the producer; the token's totalSupply after creation; emitted as LaunchCreated.parameters.supply",
  "installed": "Installation.installedSupply = the launch-token amount Core takes for the computed liquidity (rounded up), <= requested: the circulating inventory, all of it in the single position. Not emitted directly: LaunchCreated.liquidity is the installed liquidity and Core's PositionUpdated delta of the creation is the installed amount.",
  "sink": "requested - installed, minted directly to address(0) in the creation (Transfer(0x0, 0x0, sink) when nonzero); never spendable. Not an ERC-20 burn: totalSupply stays equal to requested.",
  "liquidity": "Not an input. Creation and previewInstallation compute the maximum liquidity the requested supply buys, refusing ZeroLiquidity and LiquidityAboveTickCap(liquidity, cap).",
  "rule": "Never rewrite supply to installedSupply. previewInstallation is installation math for display; create receives the same requested supply.",
